          <spine>
            <asset-clip ref="rA" offset="0s" start="33033/20000s" duration="4251247/60000s" name="这条视频从起心动念到开机为止没有超过10分钟就拍视频对于我来讲是一件非常简单的事情那么为什么要拍呢因为以我目前账号的基础播放来讲哪怕我拍的是坨屎都有5000个人会看当然首先这条视频它一定不是一条屎你耐心看完的话对你做事情会有非常大的帮助前天的话我跟我的一个学员吵了不能说吵了一架我骂了他一顿准确的来讲不止骂一次了应该骂了很多次那为什么要骂他呢是因为他明明在他赛道来讲无论是他本身自己的行业厚度还有他制作视频的能力都是非常强他已经验证了他是有拿流量的能力的但是昨天我翻看了一下最近发的视频上一条还停留在什么呢停留在七天前那我觉得对于一个老板来讲我觉得拍视频他肯定是有企图心的他肯定是想拍好他肯定是想把这件事情给做好" tcFormat="NDF" audioRole="dialogue"><title ref="rTitle" lane="1" offset="33033/20000s" duration="41041/60000s"><param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="0 -220"/><text><text-style ref="ts1">这条视频</text-style></text><text-style-def id="ts1"><text-style font="XQjuzhentiZJSY" fontSize="50" fontFace="Regular" fontColor="1 1 1 1" alignment="center"/></text-style-def></title><title ref="rTitle" lane="1" offset="7007/3000s" duration="29029/30000s"><param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="0 -220"/><text><text-style ref="ts2">从起心动念</text-style></text><text-style-def id="ts2"><text-style font="XQjuzhentiZJSY" fontSize="50" fontFace="Regular" fontColor="1 1 1 1" alignment="center"/></text-style-def></title><title ref="rTitle" lane="1" offset="33033/10000s" duration="77077/60000s"><param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="0 -220"/><text><text-style ref="ts3">到开机为止</text-style></text><text-style-def id="ts3"><text-style font="XQjuzhentiZJSY" fontSize="50" fontFace="Regular" fontColor="1 1 1 1" alignment="center"/></text-style-def></title><title ref="rTitle" lane="1" offset="11011/2400s" duration="23023/12000s"><param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="0 -220"/><text><text-style ref="ts4">没有超过10分钟</text-style></text><text-style-def id="ts4"><text-style font="XQjuzhentiZJSY" fontSize="50" fontFace="Regular" fontColor="1 1 1 1" alignment="center"/></text-style-def></title><title ref="rTitle" lane="1" offset="13013/2000s" duration="19019/30000s"><param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="0 -220"/><text><text-style ref="ts5">就拍视频</text-style></text><text-style-def id="ts5"><text-style font="XQjuzhentiZJSY" fontSize="50" fontFace="Regular" fontColor="1 1 1 1" alignment="center"/></text-style-def></title><title ref="rTitle" lane="1" offset="107107/15000s" duration="13013/20000s"><param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="0 -220"/><text><text-style ref="ts6">对于我来讲</text-style></text><text-style-def id="ts6"><text-style font="XQjuzhentiZJSY" fontSize="50" fontFace="Regular" fontColor="1 1 1 1" alignment="center"/></text-style-def></title><title ref="rTitle" lane="1" offset="467467/60000s" duration="7007/30000s"><param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="0 -220"/><text><text-style ref="ts7">是一件</text-style></text><text-style-def id="ts7"><text-style font="XQjuzhentiZJSY" fontSize="50" fontFace="Regular" fontColor="1 1 1 1" alignment="center"/></text-style-def></title><title ref="rTitle" lane="1" offset="481481/60000s" duration="43043/20000s"><param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="0 -220"/><text><text-style ref="ts8">非常简单的事情</text-style></text><text-style-def id="ts8"><text-style font="XQjuzhentiZJSY" fontSize="50" fontFace="Regular" fontColor="1 1 1 1" alignment="center"/></text-style-def></title><title ref="rTitle" lane="1" offset="61061/6000s" duration="67067/60000s"><param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="0 -220"/><text><text-style ref="ts9">那么为什么要拍呢</text-style></text><text-style-def id="ts9"><text-style font="XQjuzhentiZJSY" fontSize="50" fontFace="Regular" fontColor="1 1 1 1" alignment="center"/></text-style-def></title><title ref="rTitle" lane="1" offset="677677/60000s" duration="91091/60000s"><param name="Position" key="9999/999166631/999166633/1/100/101" value="0 -220"/><text><text-style ref="ts10">因为以我目前</text-style></text><text-style-def id="ts10"><text-style font="XQjuzhentiZJSY" f